Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:27.30,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}por la tarde
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:28.32,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que te contesta mal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:29.22,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te enfadas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.22,0:00:30.55,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}saltas y te hundes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:31.91,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Esa reacción automática
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.91,0:00:32.91,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te dice quién eres
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:33.42,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}tú de verdad
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:34.74,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}No puedes pensar lo mismo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.74,0:00:36.40,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}sentir lo mismo y esperar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:37.31,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}resultados diferentes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.31,0:00:37.93,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}solamente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.93,0:00:39.31,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}porque esta vez tienes ganas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:40.19,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}La pregunta no es si
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.19,0:00:40.75,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}funciona
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.75,0:00:42.02,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la pregunta es qué versión
